WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.032
Roxy ran out of Gem's Jewelry.

2
00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:06.862
"My wallet's gone!" a man yelled.

3
00:00:06.863 --> 00:00:11.423
"My phone's gone!" a woman shouted.

4
00:00:11.424 --> 00:00:16.264
A man looked down at his bare feet. "Who took my shoes?"

5
00:00:16.265 --> 00:00:19.071
Roxy saw something dart into an alley.

6
00:00:19.072 --> 00:00:20.892
She flew to the alley.

7
00:00:20.893 --> 00:00:23.588
A woman stood near an open door.

8
00:00:23.589 --> 00:00:25.940
The woman wore a tight bodysuit.

9
00:00:25.941 --> 00:00:29.123
Electricity sparked along its surface.

10
00:00:29.124 --> 00:00:33.052
Roxy saw money and other items poking out from a big sack.

11
00:00:33.053 --> 00:00:38.015
The woman chuckled. "This is so easy!"

12
00:00:38.016 --> 00:00:40.023
Then she vanished.

13
00:00:40.024 --> 00:00:43.583
Roxy looked around. "Where did she go?"

14
00:00:43.584 --> 00:00:45.358
The woman appeared again.

15
00:00:45.359 --> 00:00:47.708
Now the sack looked empty.

16
00:00:47.709 --> 00:00:53.364
She laughed. "It's time to steal some more!"

17
00:00:53.365 --> 00:00:56.874
"You're under arrest!" Roxy called.

18
00:00:56.875 --> 00:01:01.045
The woman smiled. "Hello, Rocket Girl."

19
00:01:01.046 --> 00:01:05.535
Fwoosh! She vanished and then appeared behind Roxy.

20
00:01:05.536 --> 00:01:08.431
"Do you think you can catch me?"

21
00:01:08.432 --> 00:01:11.583
Roxy spun to face the woman. Fwoosh!

22
00:01:11.584 --> 00:01:13.695
The woman disappeared again.

23
00:01:13.696 --> 00:01:16.245
Now she was on the other side of Roxy.

24
00:01:16.246 --> 00:01:19.556
"I'm too fast for you, Rocket Girl!"

25
00:01:19.557 --> 00:01:22.019
Roxy ran toward the woman.

26
00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:25.796
Fwoosh! The woman was at the other end of the alley now.

27
00:01:25.797 --> 00:01:28.470
She laughed.

28
00:01:28.471 --> 00:01:33.956
"Nobody can catch me. My suit gives me super speed!"

29
00:01:33.957 --> 00:01:37.332
"Who are you?" Roxy asked.

30
00:01:37.333 --> 00:01:39.015
The woman grinned.

31
00:01:39.016 --> 00:01:42.908
"I'm the fastest thief in the world—that's who I am. But

32
00:01:42.909 --> 00:01:47.022
you can call me Flick. Flick Flash." Fwoosh!

33
00:01:47.023 --> 00:01:50.039
Flick dashed off. Roxy

34
00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.286
shot after her. "Wow,"

35
00:01:52.287 --> 00:01:54.769
she thought. "Flick

36
00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:57.915
is even faster than I am!" Flick

37
00:01:57.916 --> 00:02:00.193
blasted by a newsstand. The

38
00:02:00.194 --> 00:02:02.031
wind knocked the stand over. A

39
00:02:02.032 --> 00:02:04.327
man was working inside. Magazines

40
00:02:04.328 --> 00:02:08.151
and candy fell on him. "Ugh!" Roxy

41
00:02:08.152 --> 00:02:11.138
chased Flick into the street. Flick

42
00:02:11.139 --> 00:02:14.984
zigzagged among cars, buses, and bikes. A

43
00:02:14.985 --> 00:02:17.648
man on a bike lost his balance. "Whoa!"

44
00:02:17.649 --> 00:02:22.730
He fell off. The

45
00:02:22.731 --> 00:02:24.786
bike rolled into traffic. "Ahh!"

46
00:02:24.787 --> 00:02:28.764
A delivery truck driver slammed his brakes. The

47
00:02:28.765 --> 00:02:31.745
truck skidded into the bike. Crunch! Then—

48
00:02:31.746 --> 00:02:36.699
bam! A taxi crashed into the truck.

49
00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:40.212
Roxy hurried over. "Is everyone okay?"

50
00:02:40.213 --> 00:02:42.737
The two drivers nodded.

51
00:02:42.738 --> 00:02:45.685
The man from the bike gave a thumbs-up.

52
00:02:45.686 --> 00:02:47.686
Roxy looked around.

53
00:02:47.687 --> 00:02:49.849
Flick was running toward a building.

54
00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:52.230
Roxy took off after her.

55
00:02:52.231 --> 00:02:57.943
She gasped as Flick ran up the side of the building.

56
00:02:57.944 --> 00:03:02.450
"I didn't know she could do that!" Roxy flew up after her.

57
00:03:02.451 --> 00:03:05.429
She was right behind Flick.

58
00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:07.735
Roxy reached out to grab her.

59
00:03:07.736 --> 00:03:11.937
Just then Flick zoomed past a window washer. Fwoosh!

60
00:03:11.938 --> 00:03:14.184
The worker's seat swung wildly.

61
00:03:14.185 --> 00:03:16.414
His rope snapped.

62
00:03:16.415 --> 00:03:23.034
He fell. "Rocket Girl! Help!"

